URL: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/parquet-format/pull/192#issuecomment-1426068317&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/parquet-format/pull/192#issuecomment-1426068317&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;   I think should we check that no more padding is added in all impl? At least, seems C++, Rust, parquet-mr didn&apos;t padding at the end of data.&lt;/p&gt;

</comment>
