                            <comment id="17687304" author="githubbot" created="Fri, 10 Feb 2023 22:20:05 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;shangxinli merged PR #192:&lt;br/&gt;
URL: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/parquet-format/pull/192&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/parquet-format/pull/192&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

</comment>
                            <comment id="17687450" author="githubbot" created="Sat, 11 Feb 2023 15:13:40 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;wgtmac opened a new pull request, #1025:&lt;br/&gt;
URL: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/parquet-mr/pull/1025&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/parquet-mr/pull/1025&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;   ByteStreamSplitValuesReader depends on page.num_values which includes null values to compute the total stream length. Then it throws if it fails to read enough bytes from the page buffer. This certainly happens if the page contains null values.&lt;/p&gt;

